{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15109090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:5:1510909001:1":{"text":"空が赤い……またブラッドムーンが来るのか？","source_cn":"天空变红了……血月又要来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC65B12F8B50A7ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510909002:1":{"text":"モンドさまの占いには、出ていなかったはず……","source_cn":"蒙多没有卜算到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBC75930C9F6860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510909003:0":{"text":"でも、ブラッドムーンは吉兆のはずなのに、この感じは一体……","source_cn":"血月来了，应该是吉兆。但是，感觉不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B6EB5E2756F79F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510909004:0":{"text":"ブラッドムーンは狩猟神の象徴でもあります。おそらく<style=\"highlight\">戦場に降臨</style>するつもりでしょう。クリスタルの異変もそれが原因です。","source_cn":"血月也是狩猎神象征。她很可能要<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA24FDF5D68AA572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510909005:0":{"text":"急いで<style=\"highlight\">ペルセウスを追いかけましょう</style>。戦争を止めなければ、ホーリン城の滅亡は避けられません！","source_cn":"我们得尽快<style=highlight>追上珀尔修...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8270C6EE4269B5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510909006:0":{"text":"おれも行く。","source_cn":"我和你们一起去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34F0C6CB96B0D9E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510909007:1":{"text":"お前が行ってどうする。両方から狙われるぞ。","source_cn":"你去干什么？双方的刀都会瞄准你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63BED4BE7D66054F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510909008:1":{"text":"うるさい。お前たちはおれに、<style=\"highlight\">狩猟神を殺す</style>と約束しただろ。","source_cn":"少废话。你们答应过，要<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE28E42B30A2A138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510909009:1":{"text":"ああ、そういえば。お前は自分とこの神サマに死んでほしいんだったな。","source_cn":"哦，差点忘了，你是个想弑神的“信徒”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32446D8752E58063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510909010:0":{"text":"ま、盾ぐらいにはなるか。行くぞ。","source_cn":"可以，来吧。你至少能帮我们挡几刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAB0A5D2C1C956B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat